# Vercel silently blackholes any deployment whose UPLOAD BUNDLE contains a zip
# archive: the platform serves NOT_FOUND for every host of the deployment while
# all APIs report READY/PROMOTED/aliased. Diagnosed 2026-08-04 by binary-search
# canary deploys (see TASKS.md build log). The work-bundle zip lives in git for
# the record but must never ride along in a deployment upload.
*.zip
